{
  "name": "Alert in Slack when LeadMagic credits run low",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Low credit alert\n\n### How it works\nEvery morning, checks your LeadMagic credit balance and last 7 days of usage (both free) and posts to Slack when the balance drops below your threshold, so scheduled workflows don't stop with `402 insufficient_credits`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Set the threshold in **Below threshold?**.\n2. Pick a Slack channel.\n3. Select your LeadMagic and Slack credentials.\n\n### Customization\nPoint this at an email or PagerDuty node instead of Slack, or add it as the error workflow for your other LeadMagic workflows.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "99a29db2-c525-57c0-a260-ab799e5192e6",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a3fd30e3-3272-515d-9075-7e06664e480d",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "credit",
        "operation": "getCredits"
      },
      "id": "ed028cc5-97e1-56a0-bba7-f15402f08663",
      "name": "Get balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "credit",
        "operation": "getUsage",
        "days": 7
      },
      "id": "d982ef81-275a-53d9-87ad-4208642adf63",
      "name": "Get 7-day usage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($('Get balance').item.json.credits) }}",
              "rightValue": 5000,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "66c681ef-1016-571e-9934-c9a00c3d98ba",
      "name": "Below threshold?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "text": "=:warning: LeadMagic credits are low: *{{ $('Get balance').item.json.credits }}* left.\nLast 7 days: {{ JSON.stringify($json.summary ?? {}) }}\nTop up at https://app.leadmagic.io",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "4692147f-18b1-55f7-bf4a-989a57bc1cb3",
      "name": "Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        880,
        -80
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get balance",
